# The assignment intake is /intake/ opened by the carrier door, which fixes the
# service to a claim assignment and never shows the consumer service picker —
# an adjuster should not be offered domestic surveillance. Anything that already
# points at the old /submit/ URL keeps working and lands in the same place.
/insurance-investigations/submit/*  /intake/?assignment=insurance  301
/assignment  /intake/?assignment=insurance  301
/assignment/*  /intake/?assignment=insurance  301
